1
00:00:00,752 --> 00:00:03,557
New medicines need rigorous clinical trials,

2
00:00:04,104 --> 00:00:08,983
but recruiting participants and reviewing changing records can
delay progress.

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,964
ProtocolPulse connects that work.

4
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:17,833
AI turns a trial protocol into source-linked rules, reviewed and
approved by a

5
00:00:17,863 --> 00:00:18,742
clinical lead.

6
00:00:19,678 --> 00:00:23,611
Screening checks patient records against those rules, showing
potential

7
00:00:23,641 --> 00:00:26,668
matches, conflicts, and missing evidence.

8
00:00:27,104 --> 00:00:29,539
Teams can focus their review where it matters.

9
00:00:30,511 --> 00:00:33,964
After participation begins, oversight continues.

10
00:00:34,493 --> 00:00:37,409
A new medication record triggers a targeted check.

11
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:41,890
A possible protocol conflict becomes a prioritized case

12
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:44,298
with evidence ready for review.

13
00:00:45,196 --> 00:00:48,224
The clinical lead decides what happens next.

14
00:00:49,141 --> 00:00:53,740
By streamlining trial operations, ProtocolPulse could help
promising medicines

15
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:55,261
move closer to patients.

16
00:00:55,548 --> 00:00:58,076
AI assists, people decide.
